MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_001: I may have lost to Cai in the Heroic Games, but I will\nnot be deterred.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_002: <NCA>Ask about her situation.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_003: I will face the White-Maned Demon, no matter what\nit costs me.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_004: Which means I'll have to sneak into the dungeon\nunder the colosseum. But it's guarded, as you'd guess.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_005: Can I ask you to cause a diversion so the way will\nbe clear? It wouldn't take much.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_006: I will face the White-Maned Demon, no matter what\nit costs me.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_007: Which means I'll have to sneak into the dungeon\nunder the colosseum. But it's guarded, as you'd guess.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m01_008: May I ask you to cause a diversion so the way will\nbe clear? Nothing too difficult, I promise.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m03_001: I must meet with him, no matter what it takes.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m03_002: I'll enact the plan on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=ParalogueDay, Char03} {DateTime=ParalogueMonth, Char03}{SetColor=Default}. If you want to help,\ncome see me by Seftim 8.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m03_003: I'll enact the plan on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=ParalogueDay, Char03} {DateTime=ParalogueMonth, Char03}{SetColor=Default}. If you want to help,\ncome see me by Seftim 8.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_001: We're going to enact the plan tomorrow, in fact. I lied\nand told Buccar it would be a different day.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_002: He'd only try to stop me...and I can't have anyone\nstanding in my way.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_003: We're going to enact the plan tomorrow, in fact. I lied\nand told Buccar it would be a different day
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_004: He'd only try to stop me...and I can't have anyone\nstanding in my way.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_005: I must meet with him, no matter what it takes.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_006: Now, I have to go and prepare. If you want to help,\ncome see me by the end of the day.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m04_007: Now, I have to go and prepare. If you want to help,\nplease come see me by the end of the day.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_001: I want to sneak underground and meet with the\nWhite-Maned Demon. But I need a distraction.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_002: I want to sneak underground and meet with the\nWhite-Maned Demon. But I need a distraction.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_003: I need someone to be a diversion for me. Would you\nhelp me out?
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_004: I need someone to act as a diversion for me.\nWould you be willing to help?
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_No: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_010: I see. Well, there's some time yet before we enact\nthe plan. Let me know if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m05_011: I see. Well, there's some time yet before we enact\nthe plan. Let me know if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_001: I want to sneak underground and meet with the\nWhite-Maned Demon. But I need a distraction.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_002: I want to sneak underground and meet with the\nWhite-Maned Demon. But I need a distraction.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_003: If I miss this chance, Buccar will stop me from\ntrying again... So, would you be my distraction?
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_004: If I miss this chance, Buccar will stop me from\ntrying again... So, would you be my distraction?
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_No: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_010: I see. Well, if you change your mind, come and find\nme before the end of the day.
MID_LGV_SCXX_03_m06_011: I see. Well, if you change your mind, please do come\nand find me before the end of the day.